$25,921.73 filing amount suggests this is a single-family residential property with approximately 3-5 years of accumulated delinquency based on typical Mesquite ISD millage rates (roughly $4,200-$5,800 annually for median SFR). The 217 Woodbridge Way address places this in an established Mesquite neighborhood likely built 1980s-1990s, indicating a structure play rather than land value. Carmelo Faz Nino is the primary defendant with **personal service achieved and waiver filed**, showing some level of engagement rather than total abandonment. Olga Martinez at the same address (likely spouse or co-owner) remains **unserved despite attempted personal service**, which is unusual for same-address defendants and suggests possible marital separation, death, or intentional evasion. The third defendant, AOC-2 Inc., appears to be a lienholder in rem only with failed service at their Dallas registered agent address—this could be a second lien, HOA super-lien, or contractor mechanic''s lien complicating the capital stack. The fact that Nino engaged with a waiver but hasn''t resolved $26K in debt indicates either financial paralysis, strategic delay, or lack of equity making payment irrational.\n\n## 2. FINANCIAL PICTURE\n\nThe **$25,921.73 filing amount** as of May 2026 has now grown to approximately **$28,800-$29,400** as of January 2027 (20 months post-filing) when accounting for statutory 12% penalty, 1% monthly interest, and 15-20% attorney fees compounding under Texas Tax Code §33.48. The live DCAD balance would include 2026 taxes now delinquent (add $5,200 estimated) bringing **total payoff to roughly $34,000-$35,000** to clear all liens and bring current. Assuming typical Mesquite single-family assessed values, a $5,200 annual tax bill implies **$260,000-$280,000 appraised value** (2% effective rate). The debt-to-value ratio of **12.5-13.5%** is investment-grade, but the AOC-2','\n',char(10)),NULL,'pre_judgment',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-07-07T22:48:27.027651','2026-07-07T22:48:27.027651','2026-07-07T22:48:27.027651',1,'individual','high','','',NULL,NULL);
